#: docs/zh/reference/profiles.md:23
msgid ""
"`XGL_TRANSPORT_WINDOW_CAPACITY` 可选 1、8、16、32、64、128，默认 128。`XGL_RELIABLE_INDEX_BUCKETS` 可选 "
"1、2、4、8、16、32，按 profile 默认为 Boot 1、Embedded Lite 8、其余 32。`XGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE` 可选 16、32、64、128 "
"字节，默认 Boot 32、其余 128。自适应 RTO 默认开启；高级运行时默认关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`XGL_TRANSPORT_WINDOW_CAPACITY` can be 1, 8, 16, 32, 64 or 128, with default 128. "
"`XGL_RELIABLE_INDEX_BUCKETS` can be 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 or 32. Defaults are 1 for Boot, 8 for Embedded Lite "
"and 32 otherwise. `XGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE` can be 16, 32, 64 or 128 bytes, with defaults 32 for Boot"
" and 128 otherwise. Adaptive RTO defaults on and advanced runtime defaults off."

#: docs/zh/reference/profiles.md:25
msgid ""
"`XGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE` 是生产者选择的完整帧上限，默认 2048 字节，可选 64–2048 字节。实例 MTU 必须适应该上限。生成头与安装目标记录 "
"profile、资源组合和构建身份。消费时检查实际导出，避免用消费者宏覆盖已选择的资源。Boot 要求关闭 libc fallback。"
msgstr ""
"`XGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE` selects the producer's complete-frame ceiling from 64 to 2048 bytes and "
"defaults to 2048. The instance MTU must fit this ceiling. The generated header and installed target "
"record profile, resource selection and build identity. Check the actual exports and keep application "
"macros consistent with the SDK. Boot requires libc fallback to be off."

