#: docs/zh/reference/profiles.md:37
msgid ""
"Production 还要求认证 provider，并在流量开始前显式安装可信会话。各数据包均需要放进一帧。查阅 `xgl_feature_config_t`，使用 "
"`xgl_memory_requirements()` 测量实际配置。预设名称不是实测 MCU RAM/Flash 保证。"
msgstr ""
"Production additionally requires an authentication provider and explicit trusted sessions before "
"traffic. Inspect `xgl_feature_config_t` and query `xgl_memory_requirements()` for the actual selected "
"configuration. A preset name is not a measured MCU RAM/Flash guarantee."
